{
  "uid": "jobbi-prueba-03",
  "title": "3 · Pico · ráfaga de 50 TPS",
  "description": "Guía: docs/guia-de-pruebas.md · Punto 10.4 · Escenario 2 Pico.",
  "tags": [
    "jobbi",
    "pruebas"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": true,
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Qué es esta prueba",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Comando:** `./scripts/k6-en-cluster.sh pico50`  \n**Caso del documento:** Punto 10.4 · Escenario 2 Pico.\n\n**Qué deberías ver:** el escalón 12 → 50 → 12 en Rate; el p95 cruza la línea roja durante la ráfaga; el gateway cerca del 100 % de CPU; las dos curvas de comisiones terminan juntas. Los demandantes vuelven a buscar y a veces contratan a otro prestador: suben las búsquedas y los contactos por minuto y el match rate se mueve.\n\n**Criterio de éxito:** sin degradación financiera: consistencia 100 % y DLQ = 0, aunque la latencia no cumpla.\n\nAntes de empezar: `./scripts/reiniciar-entorno.sh`. No interrumpas el script en las esperas."
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Rate · solicitudes por segundo (gateway)",
      "description": "Throughput por endpoint del caso de uso. Nominal ≈ 12 TPS.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (route) (rate(jobbi_http_request_duration_seconds_count{service=\"gateway\", route=~\".*check-out|.*check-in|.*acuerdos.*|.*billeteras.*|.*cobro\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(jobbi:http_solicitudes:rate1m{service=\"gateway\"})",
          "legendFormat": "TOTAL gateway",
          "refId": "B",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Duration · latencia del gateway (p50 / p95 / p99)",
      "description": "SLO p95 < 400 ms (línea roja). Mira el p95.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(jobbi_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{service=\"gateway\"}[1m]))) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(jobbi_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{service=\"gateway\"}[1m]))) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "B",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(jobbi_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{service=\"gateway\"}[1m]))) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "C",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 400
              }
            ]
          },
          "custom": {
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line+area"
            },
            "fillOpacity": 5
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
